  "-404866281": {
   "kind": "choice",
   "parent": -1188764170,
   "children": [
    596305838,
    1620942675,
    1219095974
   ],
   "actor": "S_CrazyOldMan",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "Yeah, right. You? Saw the werewolf?",
   "settings": {
    "m_HideUnavailable": false,
    "m_HideVisited": false,
    "m_SkipChoice": false,
    "m_ShuffleChoices": false,
    "m_TimedChoice": {
     "m_TimedChoice": false,
     "m_Duration": {
      "kind": "value",
      "value": 10
     },
     "m_Timeout": "ChooseRandom"
    },
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "590776683": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -2005615897,
   "actor": null,
   "text": "No, I saw it. I saw the werewolf!",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "1921668822": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -2005615897,
   "actor": null,
   "text": "Yes, but I also saw it. I saw the werewolf.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "596305838": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -404866281,
   "children": [
    -1037758982
   ],
   "actor": null,
   "text": "I know what I saw. It wasn’t just some animal.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "1620942675": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -404866281,
   "children": [
    -847281575
   ],
   "actor": null,
   "text": "Why would I lie about this? ",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "1219095974": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -404866281,
   "children": [
    -1009933813
   ],
   "actor": null,
   "text": "You’re the only one who seems to know anything about it.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-1037758982": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": 596305838,
   "actor": "S_CrazyOldMan",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "Alright, fine. Say I believe you. What’d it do, huh? What’d it want?",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-847281575": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": 1620942675,
   "actor": "S_CrazyOldMan",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "I don’t know. Maybe you’ve got too much time on your hands, or maybe you’re trying to make a fool out of me.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-1009933813": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": 1219095974,
   "actor": "S_CrazyOldMan",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "Alright... Maybe you’re not completely full of it. What exactly did you see?",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "543036219": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1188764170,
   "actor": "You",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "It didn’t attack me. It just... stood there. Grunted and growled. I think it was asking for food—meat, maybe.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-620181327": {
   "kind": "choice",
   "parent": -1188764170,
   "children": [
    1519918169,
    533712163
   ],
   "actor": "S_CrazyOldMan",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "Meat? You’re sure?",
   "settings": {
    "m_HideUnavailable": false,
    "m_HideVisited": false,
    "m_SkipChoice": false,
    "m_ShuffleChoices": false,
    "m_TimedChoice": {
     "m_TimedChoice": false,
     "m_Duration": {
      "kind": "value",
      "value": 10
     },
     "m_Timeout": "ChooseRandom"
    },
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "1519918169": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -620181327,
   "actor": null,
   "text": "Yes, it was able to speak a few worlds. \"Food\", and \"Meat\".",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "533712163": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -620181327,
   "actor": null,
   "text": "It was right in front of me. Asking me for Food, for meat.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-648596479": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1188764170,
   "actor": "S_CrazyOldMan",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "Meat... That’s what it said. Whispering outside my farm, middle of the night. “Meat.” Thought I was losing it...",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-1161355110": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1188764170,
   "actor": "S_CrazyOldMan",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "Then it’s true... The beast isn’t just hunting. It’s trying to communicate. God help us.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "1441147151": {
   "kind": "choice",
   "parent": -1188764170,
   "children": [
    1066553932,
    -393763580,
    938941896
   ],
   "actor": "S_CrazyOldMan",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "Stay away from it! And whatever you do, don't bring it meat! God knows what will happen!",
   "settings": {
    "m_HideUnavailable": false,
    "m_HideVisited": false,
    "m_SkipChoice": false,
    "m_ShuffleChoices": false,
    "m_TimedChoice": {
     "m_TimedChoice": false,
     "m_Duration": {
      "kind": "value",
      "value": 10
     },
     "m_Timeout": "ChooseRandom"
    },
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "1906998507": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1188764170,
   "actor": "S_CrazyOldMan",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "No, no... I'll have no part in this! Stay away from it! ",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "1066553932": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": 1441147151,
   "actor": null,
   "text": "Maybe we can help it? Break the curse?",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-393763580": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": 1441147151,
   "actor": null,
   "text": "Maybe we should bring it some meat? ",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "938941896": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": 1441147151,
   "actor": null,
   "text": "We could try to hunt it down. End it once and for all.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
